'''Nisetama Army''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] and was created by a [[Gudetama Collaboration Event|collaboration]] between Battle Cats and Sanrio's Gudetama (Hello Sanrio). During the collaboration event, this unit was available via the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 350
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Nisetama Army
|name2 = Nisetama Cat Army
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nisetama Cat Army''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Aside from its goofy appearance, Nisetama Army is just average. Nisetama is faster and stronger than pre-[[True Form]] [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] but has less range, which is decent enough, and his [[Knockback|Knockback]] can help with melee Red and Alien enemies like [[Bore]], [[One Horn]], and [[Cyberhorn]]. Better options spring up once you progress in the game, particularly Awakened Ururun and better Knockback Ubers like [[Raiden (Uber Rare Cat)|God-Emperor Raiden]] and [[Mizli (Uber Rare Cat)|Mizuririn]]. Nisetama loses usefulness due to being an older, boring Uber with no truly strong skills.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

